From 5176ec93ba94a788ff8ad0ec7a0e989f614289b8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 12:36:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Add receipt-only native session tickets

A prompt receipt poller previously had to request an interactive ticket, receiving control and operator privileges. Add explicit prompt-receipt purpose with session:receipt only, preserve interactive owner semantics, and gate receipt sockets to the single read RPC. Receipt-only reads retain principal and local ownership checks; write callers retain submit authorization.

Proof: existing interactive ticket reproduction on main e539dac returned a foreign receipt (RED). New purpose was rejected before implementation. Receipt-only tests are now GREEN, including independent local/principal mismatches, full handler refusal inventory, direct cancel denial, and GUI/CLI interactive controls. Focused authority/run_api/WS suite: 36 passed, 6 Windows-only skips. Additional native socket and drain coverage included. scripts/check: 21 checks OK.
